          "text": "General appearance and hydration examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Looks tired, not toxic. Mucous membranes moist; slightly dry. Capillary refill under 2 seconds, skin turgor okay, eyes not sunken. Mild dehydration only."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
